        {
          "id": 3311824566,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It's supported by every major compiler and widely used already in the Wireshark codebase. I do not think a massive search and replace is necessary or even beneficial. Gradual replacement is fine IMHO. But I can add it back if desired.",
