        {
          "id": 3312724649,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Agreed, but I like that this at least removed the explicit dependency for now.\n\nThat's what the \"at some point\" in \"That's something to consider at some point.\" was meant to indicate; it's a suggestion for further work after this commit, not an indication that there's something inherently wrong about this commit.\n\n(There also seem to be a bunch of other `prefs.capture_*` preferences; perhaps they should all be handled by code in `ui` for capture preferences, rather than wired into `epan/prefs.c`.)",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
